sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as Server
    participant DB as Database
    U->>B: Click "Login"
    B->>+S: POST /login
    S->>+DB: SELECT user
    DB-->>-S: row
    Note right of DB: indexed lookup
    alt valid password
        S-->>B: 200 OK + cookie
    else invalid
        S--xB: 401 Unauthorized
    end
    loop every 30s
        B-)S: heartbeat
    end
    S->>S: cleanup sessions
    deactivate S
    Note over U,B: The user sees the dashboard
    par notify
        S->>U: mail
    and log
        S->>DB: audit
    end
